  triage:title "SkillRecord.id should use ExtensionId not String (catalog.rs:36)" ;
  triage:description "SkillRecord.id is defined as String at line 36 of catalog.rs. Per RBP best practices and ADR-0011 (type safety), this should use the ExtensionId newtype defined in extensions/mod.rs, providing compile-time validation that extension ids are non-empty and consistently typed throughout the extensions module." ;
